#: scenario2:scenario2_A824F1AA_C091_499F_A49D_2C364E7DBAFF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e468eab549f181decf682d7f310365df1b230194140ebad5ac0c4bcb203c63fd
#. default-sha256: d379a5c63133875f137158d87736629a25d75750dbbf3d179adf280ff95e5612
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A824F1AA_C091_499F_A49D_2C364E7DBAFF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫The beast’s humanity began slipping away from him after that encounter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Dopo quell’incontro, l’umanità di Bestia iniziò ad abbandonarlo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37af30b0c62e929ada143925505e1bf69dc7da92dd0f525e43e3d36300ab1f99
#. default-sha256: 2206336eabe127ab5fe1c4c5d459a651d852ff8d904bbeb4e59d073ff4e19585
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CA94BCBB_0A21_4D60_AE2F_488D4AF685ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had returned to the thing I had found in the cellar. ⟪k:1⟫Actually, he prowled the "
"mansion’s halls looking more barbaric than ever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tornò ad essere la creatura che avevo trovato nella cantina.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Anzi, si aggirava per "
"le sale della villa con un’aria ancora più selvaggia."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0629C26B_E63D_4C99_96A0_0C3420D6F21C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 199bcfe875e14bd8b97cb5ad947e2f55a177642c006f41440d63ae84b49d81a8
