#: scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb079b31944a166aaf5c4af4013e3a58f2ed03eea692a4e5ba8545e05dc42d89
#. default-sha256: 41001b40630ce63bc4a73225b98cfdb18e0ac57b9d7140f7c7145f1b3cd0349d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_AF534BF7_1E63_4858_9822_AE827236AD2A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite all the effort he had put into learning to act like a human,⟪k:1⟫he now ripped the "
"velvet curtains off the wall, howling shrilly..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante tutti gli sforzi che aveva compiuto per imparare a comportarsi da umano, si "
"ritrovò a strappare le tende di velluto⟪k:1⟫in giro per la villa, ululando in modo stridulo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e1559307086a0b908466a72096249ad29c6fc956c105a9ae6d31d6a5cf4739c
#. default-sha256: 42c6720cc717aca37c3bd71fbc0072e892f49cb703f432238109eb44e15ad1cf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BA98E10A_4FFE_4B82_BC86_489544991836"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stomping back and forth through the hallways,⟪k:1⟫and ravaging the garden."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Faceva avanti e indietro lungo i corridoi sbattendo i piedi con ferocia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non "
"risparmiò nemmeno il giardino, devastandolo completamente."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 632f449a3557bec5a17e8591332e9ea4f44761e3ef9e194e1f817f6087e79805
#. default-sha256: b71b45ad260a564ee4c94d91da39e4a0019dd5e690b1ffa48cb1a0a4a04cdf09
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C475E70_A81C_4BFD_ABE3_D949B020BD8D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched him intently, though from a distance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lo osservavo attentamente, anche se da una certa distanza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe24530ba3100015013267bb1795652f734e70c1d507a29a127b6efe869bbe4d
#. default-sha256: bdb37a6371fb9fa3b43fe6560ca2a7dcaf4d13e34bfc70a4606f383605146ab2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_76DF26B7_C79C_43E6_ABEE_EA8D8BD55483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Bestia was not merely a beast,⟪k:1⟫but an out-of-control, bloodthirsty beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non era più una bestia qualunque,⟪k:1⟫ma un mostro assetato di sangue e fuori controllo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d1ea4a6ff73c2d3049941bc668afa134076e7b755b51aa9059e1ea13a24116e
#. default-sha256: d0be9fc6de2442d53254ce87bdc84db3765e2df202b9e4824c3aafe30ffe7dd4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BB3EA482_6936_4D0F_A580_E91CE2D177F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just a few days ago, we had been tending the garden together,⟪k:1⟫but that was no longer "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Giusto pochi giorni prima, stavamo curando insieme il giardino,⟪k:1⟫ma non era più possibile "
"continuare."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67c9f11341f3e3bce94b8526baadf218326cbfb2e9b4c07b1d3fe9c666c93a5a
#. default-sha256: 3de6549f08eddc23068ffe809d6d5d5dfd7954f0f4f6e83d0f64f9edaec007b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F3463257_B8F0_4A65_9B30_63C2DAA67D32"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was quite disappointed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero alquanto delusa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6827B29D_4F36_4432_9125_0FA63C1350E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
