#: scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd3f9c9941948f16cce55331f9b227d26dc2b31a676a3017920f8d9a6e2be86
#. default-sha256: b1d74d2cbb47e15c7aacd211c2d6f4dee698f561613c3be058884696b524d990
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BD734C9A_6BE8_4DF1_A1F8_9420881B20A6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, Bestia discovered my hiding place. ⟪k:1⟫I had not felt regret in a very long "
"time, but I felt deep regret in that moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Alla fine, Bestia scoprì il mio nascondiglio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non avevo avuto rimpianti per molto "
"tempo, ma in quel momento provai un profondo rammarico."

#: scenario2:scenario2_99E6D8AF_45E1_4FA0_998C_156756077979
