#: scenario2:scenario2_4948A3D4_B1E4_443D_8534_D5A1DBC6F668
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be1a88ef9107b6e90cc2b2d9f21fdc1b6aaca8ae2ef6d52c9fad6419b5b03fa6
