"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eeeeheeheeheeheeheeheehheeheeheeheeheeheeheehee!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Proprio cosìììì! Sono un "
"moooostroooooooo!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9878FC55_2DCC_45D0_84A4_994CC760A3CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54789c820c9479f4ce31d0dcc836b3a8aaa1a658652dc6e1312103559b4231a8
#. default-sha256: ac726066e46316d8ecc4099ad297b2debe70c95e65a38e8336ff9c3db4ae1d12
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9878FC55_2DCC_45D0_84A4_994CC760A3CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫And by killing... ⟪k:8⟫no one can defy me!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E continuando a uccidere... ⟪k:8⟫nessuno potrà "
"sconfiggermi!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8cf2769a209aac18cccb286278099ddd6e74681cdd51425dc2f53f95ad1b93a
#. default-sha256: 9794e8be6aed034ff00ec1520599650f2407c0e5aefa313d67c4234f847a31c1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A82AD4A_21A6_4804_91A1_325B50427DA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have to show the world that I—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that beasts are the most frightening "
"things on this earth!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Devo dare prova al mondo intero che io—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫che ⟪k:5⟫le bestie⟪k:6⟫ sono la "
"cosa più spaventosa sulla faccia della terra!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c34ca89eb59cf97446383d60a9fb4879dc71f3d9dd9ee475fa37f9caa518fc2
#. default-sha256: a971ea26692e8a5a7b84e1d4767839272e9f04daa7e127733ce297b75c414726
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8BDF044C_D186_4600_9FE0_2F771AD37AA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The beast began to change his style, making sick banquets out of his kills."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La bestia cominciò a cambiare i suoi metodi, sfruttando le proprie vittime per "
"sanguinari banchetti."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a22b4f12224ef65393ec20faba033427cd8f9fe5b3247a34e0dff2c02d9bdf45
#. default-sha256: 15d4d4f2d50f394c97a742983dfc14f2cfefa31a56b682f48923203f4e661eb0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6D0F9BE3_EE7F_4A02_9B59_FD751F965ABD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would tie his guests up in the cellar, playing with them for hours until they "
"finally died. Some days, he would drain them of their blood and bathe in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Certe volte, legava i suoi ospiti in cantina, giocando con loro per ore fino alla loro "
"morte. ⟪k:1⟫Altre volte, li prosciugava del loro sangue, per poi immergervisi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2eef9cd46d561c28c441443d3e9d979d3c9276b18b1b974c3de0ed87976d5af
#. default-sha256: 5622f033a2e5358428d2ef927126e5a37fc1cec05ce5fef343fc07e95dc15c01
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_43450F3B_CB83_4100_A6A9_9D62AAD5DF0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Some days, he would spread them out on the table and feast upon them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E altre volte ancora, li sparpagliava sul tavolo, banchettando con i loro resti."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31cb6aa2703166aa98c3ec0a2160d79af5d8cc6f483600c5e3f3ffba55aee926
#. default-sha256: f0eab34828fcf3e059a2bf56a6e0438f828a7e84dfe56b097b7ad043d650d5fc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C090D098_8DF8_4383_BAEF_1AEA5CC2C259"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every week, another atrocious party. He did everything imaginable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ogni settimana, una nuova atroce festa.⟪k:1⟫Fece qualunque cosa immaginabile."

#: scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83d8878a519f5a015a6235a17317c6bd3f4d5925ac2fe88afaccbde53c6c45ed
#. default-sha256: 7515e3566d2f0f813eb8e3f2c5f6c6a9ef59367057e3c8c7d4477a24ab9108af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_06FE9D10_1C06_46A2_9E94_CF2DE181C38A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a faithful servant of this house,⟪k:1⟫I am confident I can do most anything I am asked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come fedele servitrice di questa casa, sono fiduciosa di poter fare quasi tutto quel che mi "
"viene chiesto."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb9c64815eca260b6a00275a7acc6516bd112e010bf3d3aa75770d1b76767111
#. default-sha256: 41e63acd468ca95bb4790b18701b6f144a27d2cd721411788f492cbb9b19fb51
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F4AF7F68_0BC0_4848_92DB_988A42C2FD80"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though you can surely imagine my surprise at having to use the cooking skills I learned "
"while serving the flaxen-haired family to do ⟪k:1⟫that⟪k:2⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia lei può ben immaginare la mia sorpresa nel vedere le mie doti culinarie, apprese "
"lavorando per la famiglia dai capelli biondi, sfruttate per ⟪k:1⟫quello⟪k:2⟫."

#: scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 352ef3b47cb4c9a2209af5b6baf72af2c41f7cc7058cbf3eb80e8fa29e18e819
#. default-sha256: 61e90dac1dc497034a5686c5e6d0e941ec37aed21589d3e2b5f0a7a417a770d1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_530C961D_CCDA_4F61_845A_C516BABF7908"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can only wonder if it actually tasted any good."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Posso soltanto chiedermi se davvero avesse un buon sapore."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ab31dcc6f6b8e6899952e3350e82a7a0cfc01fbdfeafbbd9956e4753ffae97
#. default-sha256: 47048e14ff61f3f441c6565fb3bea2e5a6937ed212635aeb8ea6604376d024a0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0C5BD24B_7281_4455_A109_26B21102000D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bestia’s peculiar sword was always with him for his twisted banquets of self-gratification. "
"⟪k:1⟫However much blood stained it, it never lost its sheen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La peculiare spada di Bestia era sempre con lui nei suoi deviati banchetti di "
"autogratificazione. ⟪k:1⟫Per quanto fosse macchiata di sangue, non perdeva mai la propria "
"lucentezza."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbc89db7359ae2949e2669c9e9307e74556a349387d0bff32f27df06659ca310
#. default-sha256: d666a85535797f1b75e918e7f216d7da703161d922662a07e68b1d6adbcdda40
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1953702F_7296_4723_BCE0_1F8BD83EACCE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though the sword drank of the flesh of humans."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era come se la spada bevesse dalla carne degli umani."

#: scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfc8a372c60e63bcd18d6a5aaa81ddfc3f22b13a356bade6056352c7494b3e6c
#. default-sha256: 7d9d26a5e569a885aa8d83dd831eeb2e2253f78fd22f67221601c2325c8950d3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8542B195_B8E7_4EAE_8626_225DEC8E1FDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master, can you imagine just how wretched I felt?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Padrone, riesce a immaginare quanto mi sentissi miserabile?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff71cb68f79bf1328520c63b6c41734878d2e40a9a121ada87af8c82eaa7872
#. default-sha256: 1168087aefd2b432b29466dc3f2d383c9244fb30fcc49fcfc47df436f63d2af9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_35809AC2_871E_4E58_ACF8_77BC037F72A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion, once a beautiful sight to behold, reeked of death and acrimony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La villa, che un tempo era uno spettacolo meraviglioso da ammirare, puzzava di morte e "
"acredine."

#: scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8c62aa9cf1d63c892e31febde0b19760b9538fcddf962a8259083019b3c9d56
#. default-sha256: 7fce6efeb0157c8fa153700c7057405b3228af16723be958509203a50a87d218
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_689F9549_2E43_45D4_8E24_B15BC5CDB8A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The stench of rotting flesh seeped up from the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il fetore della carne in decomposizione si diffondeva dalla cantina."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f24bbcfd9491b0c7071a327e0f0692ec3a748f03e9773c8ed46983eda4ec7e15
#. default-sha256: b729dc7d5da94336590a326370f31b5f85b1a6961b562f9e6b16a627b9780a25
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5BF7EDE5_0CBD_45DB_B4EC_8AC9173E9A8C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even the years it spent forsaken and in ruins were preferable to that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche gli anni trascorsi nell’abbandono e nella rovina erano preferibili a tutto quello."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2d43b30dcdf0541f9c4d40fc174f13f764f01a2d3328cbd1833b92858ea662b
#. default-sha256: eec9a405265578e6a0106835789be10c19c444f8265b98176488919365d2569c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FA8D4794_63A8_4D8F_A7EB_100E4A25EC3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps I only had myself to blame."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O forse ero io l’unica a dover essere incolpata."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6c8a11183d77f418e0fbb443477d80f587d82e771c95a3db49b0bbf5a8ff287
#. default-sha256: 6215edfce5e7c6771533a6aeebf21bd51e278b43e9131b17447814e723e02bc2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E3B343BD_E899_4022_9C41_51CE8670C6E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was I who had invited the beast into the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero stata io ad aver invitato la bestia a far parte della villa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66b71aeefc79ef4d96ab648dab0e4311570cab54494ec493ef0e3e3d3870bab7
#. default-sha256: af479dc3173308c185b988394e74be81e56642a203cbab92f9720101efb1c054
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF896223_520A_4C04_8CE2_96126F1601DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫More, ⟪k:1⟫moooore⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫Not enough...⟪k:4⟫This isn’t enough to satisfy me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Di più, ⟪k:1⟫ancoraaaaa⟪k:2⟫... ⟪k:3⟫Non è abbastanza...⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non bastano a "
"soddisfarmi..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3071933768c266999d01d6742ba61bb1c1fc342d410543a55d6fdba28f3c362b
#. default-sha256: 97b70eabb56165c2e7bade0a78333270a9a09271526568a5dcbdd40a3f0d5834
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_15FEBCF0_88B6_45E8_86BF_74FECCE3C1F4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Bestia still sought to hold more of his perverse parties.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lost villagers were "
"no longer enough to quell his urges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma Bestia continuava a voler organizzare sempre più feste.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Gli abitanti del "
"villaggio smarriti non erano più sufficienti a sedare⟪k:3⟫i suoi impulsi."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc7f92a1da985a796586ab02641036244c71586f8b4a0c1c47620307f11ea181
#. default-sha256: f416f2d031da99f41311375a3dafde899e230a9fec64c7d2267dd97e54c339fb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E470691_8AFE_449B_B23A_2012264CBAE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was, indeed, a genuine beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And in time, this is what he began to wish for:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era proprio un’autentica bestia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E col tempo, iniziò a desiderare questo:"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d49d9feaf2c51b567749fbc56eb247cb5c58ec09d643404767757fd56f55ce5
#. default-sha256: 0f6fc8486e4b31554ee47702bc22c8b3ad931904be8aa759ecc419f7ee18ccc4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B5A78AB_13CA_492C_9571_D09676070009"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Can’t you get me any better prey?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Something truly exquisite!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The perfect "
"prey to quench this maddening thirst of mine!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non sapete trovarmi una preda migliore?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Voglio qualcosa di veramente squisito!⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫La preda perfetta per placare questa mia sete esasperante!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e919c8c5578ecfd89ae5516b57133ff12d331affc017eb096b57fe5d17638756
#. default-sha256: e86f0ac5bcb1900a02db2796fc5a13163a25fab29ce5a7151ca0a1726696e044
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B2F77B85_76EC_4DBB_9564_A2739C441FAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you know what he meant when he asked for the “perfect” prey, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sa cosa intendeva quando chiese la preda “perfetta”, Padrone?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 939720e3a2de20f6bde06783aec4cab24812d6a873ab1c668bdb1ec968ffd592
#. default-sha256: e98445a13f57c6325d98fff14fbbf979dd4004647d2e28dd9693cb1f790d86d5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9170792_5C88_465B_BDB7_DBDD7D3CFC33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a hero, someone courageous enough to stand up to him, with whom he could enjoy a "
"battle to the death."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forse un eroe, qualcuno abbastanza coraggioso da resistergli, con il quale avrebbe potuto "
"godere di una battaglia all’ultimo sangue."

#: scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dad5fd9269ad80918c5e358830e85a8dee5594204e8e6fe291786c24f08cf32
#. default-sha256: 0ec6b58dd340615ac22a54a0b9c552b311fc0b75dae0d991f0cf470fefe05e3c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ED8F0C0F_DF6E_4C21_8DD8_E3C6463496E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perhaps a dazzling young nymph to satisfy his other primal urges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or perhaps what "
"he wanted was not human at all,⟪k:3⟫but a demon or a phantom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forse un’affascinante giovane ninfa che soddisfasse i suoi altri impulsi primari.⟪k:1⟫ O "
"forse quello che voleva non era affatto un essere umano, bensì un demone, o un fantasma."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 730cbdfe336bb0d238c2862eabbef18dbb0e415947cf36644d417e2bdc014627
#. default-sha256: 3ec3752967b3bda37fd7e91c47b32a074c4763bb0e3cc30e4afe25014b748084
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4BDF0F89_2E12_4091_8E35_7392A6CC8A44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would soon find out, as the mansion attempted to grant his wish, bringing yet another "
"guest to the house on the cliff.⟪k:1⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’avrei scoperto presto, quando la villa avrebbe tentato di esaudire⟪k:1⟫il suo desiderio, "
"portando ancora un altro ospite nella casa sulla scogliera.⟪k:2⟫"
